All area of earth with be covered other than shaded area.

\begin{aligned}
& \text { shaded area }=2\left[2 \pi \mathrm{R}^2(1-\cos \theta)\right] \\
& =4 \pi \mathrm{R}^2\left[1-\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}\right]=2 \pi \mathrm{R}^2[2-\sqrt{3}]
\end{aligned}

